# Graphify: a code-understanding layer for our development workflow only.
# It is never imported by backend/ and never runs against submitted papers —
# its doc pass produces INFERRED edges, and adjudication here is deterministic.
# GRAPH_REPORT.md is committed so agents can read it without rebuilding.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md

# Framer MCP helper and its endpoint. The URL carries a secret in its query
# string, so neither is committed. Design reference only: Framer is not a
# deploy target, the Next.js site is.
.framer-mcp.py
.framer-url

# Captured Framer HTML, used as a design reference for the port.
.framer-capture/
